@startuml sequence_diagram
' Scenario what-if sequence

actor Planner
participant "Copilot (React)" as C
participant "AI Gateway" as G
participant "Scenario Agent" as S
participant "Attribution Agent" as A
participant "Forecast Agent" as F
participant "Data Agent (MCP)" as D
participant "Governance Agent" as V

Planner -> C: "GLP-1 +5pp in SE -> DiGiorno by Q3?"
C -> G: authenticate + route (frontier)
G --> C: token / route
C -> S: query + policy context
S -> A: causal attribution (A2A)
A --> S: driver effects (sign-consistent)
S -> F: run forecast (+shock, MinT)
F --> S: P10/P50/P90
S -> D: fetch banner list + DQ flags (MCP)
D --> S: data + quality caveats
S -> V: guardrail check
V --> S: approved (no price, cite run)
S --> C: structured result + run ID
C --> Planner: narrated answer + run ID
@enduml